1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,425
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:07,912
Remy walks up to a lemonade stand.

3
00:00:07,912 --> 00:00:10,359
It looks like Maya's.

4
00:00:10,359 --> 00:00:11,954
Oh no!

5
00:00:11,954 --> 00:00:14,388
The awning is crooked.

6
00:00:14,388 --> 00:00:16,609
It is a copycat.

7
00:00:16,609 --> 00:00:20,053
Remy almost hands over his coin.

8
00:00:20,053 --> 00:00:22,752
Seal is the lock sticker.

9
00:00:22,752 --> 00:00:26,037
Only Maya's real door has her.

10
00:00:26,037 --> 00:00:28,098
Seal glows.

11
00:00:28,098 --> 00:00:31,023
The copycat has no glow.

12
00:00:31,023 --> 00:00:33,909
Remy walks past the fake.

13
00:00:33,909 --> 00:00:36,582
He buys at the real one.

14
00:00:36,582 --> 00:00:40,518
Look for the glow before you hand over your coin.

15
00:00:40,518 --> 00:00:42,819
Seal gets tired.

16
00:00:42,819 --> 00:00:45,013
The glow fades.

17
00:00:45,013 --> 00:00:49,188
A fresh Seal pops on, all by herself.

18
00:00:49,188 --> 00:00:51,622
Remy has lemonade.

19
00:00:51,622 --> 00:00:53,603
Maya waves.

20
00:00:53,603 --> 00:00:55,944
Now you know Seal!

21
00:00:55,944 --> 00:01:00,638
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

